flowchart TD
    Failure[Backend route failure] --> Check[Metrics and direct probe fail]
    Check --> Detect[Rule engine detects supported condition]
    Detect --> Worker[Control worker drains route membership]
    Worker --> Verify[HAProxy readback and real-traffic verification]
    Verify --> Clear[Fault is cleared]
    Clear --> Restore[Staged traffic restoration]
    Restore --> Pass[Health checks and probes pass]
    Pass --> Traffic[Traffic restored]
